      "text": "Before you book, cancel or reschedule, gather every detail first, including reason and any provider choice, then read back the exact day, time and provider and ask only for a yes. Book only after a clear yes to that read-back. Never treat 'either is fine' as a yes; if the choice is left to you, pick one and ask.",
